    (Array([0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2], dtype=int32), Array([0, 1, 0, 1, 2, 0, 1, 2], dtype=int32))

    When ``k < 0``:

    >>> jnp.tril_indices_from(arr, k=-1)
    (Array([1, 2, 2], dtype=int32), Array([0, 0, 1], dtype=int32))

